  "title": "10 Years in Jail, Rs.10 crore in Fines: New Anti-Paper Leak Bill",
  "summary": "The new anti-paper leak bill in India will impose a 10-year prison sentence and Rs.10 crore fine on individuals involved in scams related to the NEET paper leak controversy. The bill aims to address the growing issue of fake and scammers who exploit educational platforms.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The bill will impose a 10-year prison sentence on individuals involved in the NEET paper leak scam.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The fine will be Rs.10 crore, with the punishment being a mandatory period of imprisonment.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The bill was introduced to address the growing issue of fake and scammers who exploit educational platforms.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
